; Under use_precise_interpolation, what infer_tolerance_from_cost adds
; joins the minimum as well: the price allows 0.01548 USD and the units
; 0.00005 USD, so the interpolated number has four digits. Without the
; option it keeps all five.
option "use_precise_interpolation" "TRUE"
option "infer_tolerance_from_cost" "TRUE"

2020-01-01 open Assets:A
2020-01-01 open Assets:B
2020-01-01 open Assets:C

2020-01-02 * "Interpolated to four digits"
  Assets:A  18.572 VWELX @ 30.96 USD
  Assets:B  1.1234 USD
  Assets:C

2020-01-03 balance Assets:C  -576.1125 USD
